          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus went on into Jericho and was passing through. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was a chief tax collector there named Zacchaeus, who was rich. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was trying to see who Jesus was, but he was a little man and could not see Jesus because of the crowd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he ran ahead of the crowd and climbed a sycomore tree to see Jesus, who was going to pass that way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus came to that place, he looked up and said to Zacchaeus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zacchaeus hurried down and welcomed him with great joy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the people who saw it started grumbling, “This man has gone as a guest to the home of a sinner!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zacchaeus stood up and said to the Lord, “Listen, sir! I will give half my belongings to the poor, and if I have cheated anyone, I will pay back four times as much.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
