          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Jesus said this, he went on ahead of them to Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As he came near Bethphage and Bethany at the Mount of Olives, he sent two disciples ahead ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
